#006 | 2026-03-11
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
reduce the fps to 15, include an A* algorithm to help the ai find a better
path through the levels
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Response summary:
  - Reduced FPS to 15: tick(15) in graphics_renderer.py, default=15 in main.py
  - Added astar() function to agent.py: 8-directional A* with per-cell costs
    (unknown=2x, visited=1.5x, free=1x, wall=impassable), octile heuristic,
    max_nodes budget for real-time safety
  - Added AStarAgent to agent.py:
      * Builds 256×256 occupancy grid (CELL_SIZE=64 Doom units per cell)
      * Ray-casts depth buffer each frame to mark FREE / WALL cells
      * BFS to find nearest UNKNOWN cell as exploration target
      * A* replans path every 30 frames
      * Steers by comparing current angle to waypoint bearing
      * Switches to combat mode (retreat + fire) on health loss
  - Enabled depth buffer in game.py (set_depth_buffer_enabled)
  - Registered 'astar' in AGENTS dict and startup menu

