#016 | 2026-03-14
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
remove all of the current algorithms. rebuild the list with 3 new algorithms
that are commonly used in video games that use AI pathfinding
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Response summary:
  - Removed: RandomAgent, WanderAgent, HeuristicAgent, AStarAgent,
    ThetaStarAgent, DijkstraAgent, FloodFillAgent, PotentialFieldsAgent
  - Added FlowFieldAgent (Supreme Commander / Planetary Annihilation style):
      * Multi-source Dijkstra from goal outward; numpy vectorized direction grid
      * O(1) per-frame lookup; rebuilds every _FIELD_TTL=60 frames
  - Added WaypointGraphAgent (Quake / Half-Life / Counter-Strike style):
      * Sparse free-cell sampling every _WP_SPACING=12 cells
      * Bresenham LOS check connects visible pairs; A* on sparse graph
      * Rebuilds graph every _GRAPH_TTL=90 frames
  - Added HPAStarAgent (Dragon Age: Origins / StarCraft style):
      * 16×16 cluster grid; abstract entrance nodes connected via local A*
      * Two-level search: abstract path then local refinement per cluster
  - Updated AGENTS dict: {flow_field, waypoint, hpa_star}
  - Updated main.py: default agent → hpa_star, menu default index → 3

